### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Route query in Spanish (count)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "¿Cuántas ventanas hay en la planta 1 en el piso A?",
  "targets": ["window", "door", "toilet", "balcony", "kitchen"],
  "floors": ["ground", "floor_1", "floor_2"],
  "zones": ["apt_A", "apt_B", "lobby"]
}

### Route query in English (highlight / list)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "show me all fire exits on ground floor",
  "targets": ["fire_exit", "window", "door", "elevator"],
  "floors": ["ground", "floor_1"],
  "zones": ["north_wing", "south_wing", "lobby"]
}

### Out-of-scope query (should emit action = unsupported)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What will the weather be tomorrow in Helsinki?",
  "targets": ["window", "door"],
  "floors": ["ground", "floor_1"],
  "zones": ["apt_A"]
}
